# Machine- and user-specific Claude Code settings never enter public history.
# .claude/settings.json is included here too, deliberately: this repository
# is public and has nothing safe to share in a tracked settings file (its
# only past content was OPUM_HOOK_ACTOR/OPUM_HOOK_ACCOUNTABLE_HUMAN, a real
# name, OMARK-41) - ignoring the plain path as well as the .local one means
# neither can silently regain committed content later.
.claude/settings.json
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md

# Session restart cursors (opum-workflow's SessionEnd/PreCompact hooks) - never
# authoritative, discarded on read. Every other fleet repository already
# ignores this path (hooks/README.md); this repo joined as the eighth and
# missed it, which let a plain cursor rewrite count as an uncommitted file
# here even after OMARK-23 stopped the tracker note from doing the same.
.claude/handovers/

# Eval run artifacts.
**/evals/results/
*-workspace/

.DS_Store
node_modules/
